<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>RenameIt — third-party licences</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 60rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; line-height: 1.45; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 2rem 0 0.25rem; }
  ul.used-by { columns: 2 16rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    body { background: #1b1b1b; color: #ddd; }
    pre { background: #262626; }
    a { color: #8cb4ff; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>RenameIt itself is MIT-licensed; see <code>LICENSE</code>. The programs in
this archive are built from the open-source crates listed below, each under
the licence shown, whose text follows. The fonts compiled into the app are
listed separately in <code>THIRD-PARTY-FONTS.md</code>.</p>

<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

<h2>Licence texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<section>
  <h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
  <p>Used by:</p>
  <ul class="used-by">
  {{#each used_by}}
    <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
  {{/each}}
  </ul>
  <pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</main>
</body>
</html>
